 "why": "Near miss: Intro to Blender lesson 5 (\"The mug has two new edge loops and a beveled rim\"). The learner added the two loop cuts and a Bevel modifier with Segments 3 and Limit Method Angle, but dragged the Amount field back to 0 while scrubbing it (width 0.0). A Bevel at width 0 rounds nothing: the rim is still a hard 90 degree edge in the viewport and the render. The modifier and its segment count are in the dump; its size is zero.",
