  "id": "s5",
  "index": 5,
  "title": "Loop cuts and bevels",
  "file": "mug.blend",
  "instructions": "Select the mug and press Ctrl+R over its side to add two edge loops near the base. Then in Modifier Properties choose Add Modifier > Generate > Bevel, set Amount to 0.02 m, Segments to 3 and Limit Method to Angle so only the rim is rounded. Save (Cmd+S).",
